{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/2009/resume-on-youtube/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"CodeSpud","author":"@codespud"}},"related":{"nodes":[{"fields":{"slug":"/2019/how-to-use-custom-domains-to-github-pages/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"How to Use Custom Domains with Github Pages","date":"22 April 2019","isoDate":"2019-04-22","tags":["website","blogging"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2014/quick-and-free-way-to-set-up-your-app-using-heroku/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Quick and Free Way to Set Up Your App using Heroku","date":"20 April 2014","isoDate":"2014-04-20","tags":["website","devops"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/bit-ly-a-simple-url-shortener/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Bit.ly, A Simple URL Shortener","date":"17 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-17","tags":["utility","website"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/what-browser/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"What Browser?","date":"10 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-10","tags":["browser","website"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/funny-video-animator-vs-animated/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Funny Video: Animator vs Animated","date":"8 October 2009","isoDate":"2009-10-08","tags":["fun","animation","video"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/ocr-api-on-google-docsnot-yet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"OCR API on Google Docs(not yet)","date":"30 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-30","tags":["website","google","api"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/project-10100-the-voting-begins/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Project 10^100: The Voting Begins","date":"25 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-25","tags":["website","google"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/picasa-3-5-comes-with-face-recognition/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Picasa 3.5 comes with Face Recognition","date":"24 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-24","tags":["google","website","images"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/nes-on-javascript/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"NES on Javascript","date":"21 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-21","tags":["game","javascript","website","fun"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/xoxo-creativity/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"XOXO Creativity","date":"20 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-20","tags":["website","fun"]}},{"fields":{"slug":"/2009/m-i-stupid/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"M I STUPID?","date":"19 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-19","tags":["website","fun"]}}]},"markdownRemark":{"id":"92a75b21-39a0-5355-ab18-18464240e9cc","excerpt":"Streaming Video giant, Youtube, recently announced a Resume feature along with other improvements for their groundbreaking service. (Cheers! claps! Bring in the beer! LOL).","html":"<div style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n  <img border=\"0\" src=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_BBS5bkzuLXM/SrTbWg_-NnI/AAAAAAAACg8/C9JxDO7GXBk/s320/youtubea23123.jpg\">\n</div>\n<p>Streaming Video giant, Youtube, recently announced a Resume feature along with other improvements for their groundbreaking service. (Cheers! claps! Bring in the beer! LOL). <!--more-->Gone will be the days where you had to restart a video just to continue where you left of. Now you dont need to restart a whole video or pause till the video fully loads then skip every so and so, just to pick up where you last watched.</p>\n<p>Note the feature will only work for resumes past the 3 minute mark – meaning any resumes less than mentioned duration are ignored – so you need to run the video from the start again. A perfectly logical limitation. </p>\n<p>This addition is a big step forward for online media players – hopefully other video sites will follow suit. 🙂  For more info go <a href=\"http://googlesystem.blogspot.com/2009/09/youtube-resume.html\">here</a></p>","timeToRead":1,"fields":{"slug":"/2009/resume-on-youtube/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Resume on Youtube!","date":"September 19, 2009","longDate":"19 September 2009","isoDate":"2009-09-19","tags":["website","video"],"featured_image":null,"featured_image_attribution":null,"contentType":null}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/2009/resume-on-youtube/","tags":["website","video"]}},"staticQueryHashes":["43041287","764694655"],"slicesMap":{}}